        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right great toe pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Pain for 3–4 days around the base of the right great toe, described as throbbing and burning; 6/10 at baseline and up to 8/10 after a long shift. Worse walking and at night, with difficulty wearing usual closed-in sneakers. No clear trauma recalled; patient is unsure whether she may have kicked a bed leg the previous week."
      }
    },
